# Atlas Stats Demo
# Shows session analytics and progress tracking

Output stats.gif

Set Shell "zsh"
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 800
Set Height 500
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set Padding 15
Set TypingSpeed 40ms

# Weekly stats (default)
Type "atlas stats"
Enter
Sleep 2.5s

# Monthly overview
Type "atlas stats month"
Enter
Sleep 2.5s

# Filter by project
Type "atlas stats --project atlas"
Enter
Sleep 2.5s

